Foreign costs on default-commodity postings are diagnosed at their source.

========== API ==========

balanceHistory({ valuation: 'cost', dateBasis: 'transaction' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity EUR
  format 1,000.00 EUR
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-01 Foreign costs on SEK postings
  Assets:Cash  100 SEK {2 EUR}
  Equity:Opening  -200 SEK {1 EUR}

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "date": "2024-01-01",
    "amount": "-100",
    "commodity": "SEK"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] A SEK posting cannot have a lot cost in EUR. Amounts in the default commodity are valued at face value.
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:10:3
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:11:3
